learning is clustering.

06:14:40.100 --> 06:14:42.814
So let's understand exactly
what is clustering.

06:14:42.814 --> 06:14:43.700
So a clustering

06:14:43.700 --> 06:14:46.400
basically is the process
of dividing the data sets

06:14:46.400 --> 06:14:48.900
